==================== PYCHARM → VS CODE SHORTCUTS ====================

FILE & NAVIGATION
Shift + Shift         → Ctrl + P              Open/Search File
Ctrl + B             → F12                   Go to Definition
Ctrl + Alt + Left    → Alt + Left            Go Back
Ctrl + Alt + Right   → Alt + Right           Go Forward

SEARCH
Ctrl + F             → Ctrl + F              Find
Ctrl + R             → Ctrl + H              Replace
Ctrl + Shift + F     → Ctrl + Shift + F      Find in Project
Ctrl + Shift + R     → Ctrl + Shift + H      Replace in Project

EDITING
Ctrl + D             → Shift + Alt + Down    Duplicate Line
Ctrl + Y             → Ctrl + Shift + K      Delete Line
Shift + Alt + Up/Down→ Alt + Up/Down         Move Line
Ctrl + /             → Ctrl + /              Comment Line
Ctrl + Shift + /     → Shift + Alt + A       Block Comment

REFACTORING
Shift + F6           → F2                    Rename
Alt + Enter          → Ctrl + .              Quick Fix
Alt + F7             → Shift + F12           Find References

FORMATTING
Ctrl + Alt + L       → Shift + Alt + F       Format Code
Ctrl + Alt + O       → Shift + Alt + O       Organize Imports

DEBUGGING
Shift + F10          → Ctrl + F5             Run
Shift + F9           → F5                    Debug
Ctrl + F8            → F9                    Toggle Breakpoint
F8                   → F10                   Step Over
F7                   → F11                   Step Into
Shift + F8           → Shift + F11           Step Out

EXPLORER & TERMINAL
Alt + 1              → Ctrl + Shift + E      Explorer
Alt + F12            → Ctrl + `              Terminal

